      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Power / cost notes (what to say in report)\n",
        "\n",
        "To justify “power-aware design”:\n",
        "\n",
        "Accel-only: fewer sensors → lower battery use than accel+gyro.\n",
        "\n",
        "Small CNN with SeparableConv1D + GlobalAveragePooling:\n",
        "\n",
        "reduces parameters and multiplications (MACs)\n",
        "\n",
        "avoids big dense layers\n",
        "\n",
        "GRU instead of LSTM:\n",
        "\n",
        "fewer gates → fewer computations\n",
        "\n",
        "EarlyStopping:\n",
        "\n",
        "less training cost (Colab time)\n",
        "\n",
        "TFLite INT8 quantization:\n",
        "\n",
        "smaller model, faster inference on mobile CPUs, typically lower power"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "C1f2U3xEoXvu"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Export a quantized TFLite model (INT8)\n",
        "\n",
        "Train one final model on all subjects’ windows, then convert."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Y5ZrPBYroZkP"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# Build full window dataset for final training (still realistic: this is for deployment, not evaluation)\n",
        "X_all, y_all, groups_all = window_all_subjects(accel_df, subjects=np.sort(accel_df[\"subject\"].unique()),\n",
        "                                              window_size=128, stride=64, purity=0.8)\n",
        "\n",
        "classes, cls2id, id2cls = fit_label_encoder(y_all)\n",
        "y_all_id = encode_labels(y_all, cls2id)\n",
        "\n",
        "# standardize with global stats for deployment\n",
        "mean = X_all.mean(axis=(0,1), keepdims=True)\n",
        "std  = X_all.std(axis=(0,1), keepdims=True) + 1e-8\n",
        "X_all_n = (X_all - mean)/std\n",
        "\n",
        "model = build_tiny_cnn((128,3), len(classes))\n",
        "model.fit(make_tf_dataset(X_all_n, y_all_id, batch_size=128, training=True),\n",
        "          epochs=10, verbose=1)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Representative dataset for INT8 calibration\n",
        "def rep_data_gen():\n",
        "    for i in range(200):\n",
        "        yield [X_all_n[i:i+1].astype(np.float32)]\n",
        "\n",
        "converter = tf.lite.TFLiteConverter.from_keras_model(model)\n",
        "converter.optimizations = [tf.lite.Optimize.DEFAULT]\n",
        "converter.representative_dataset = rep_data_gen\n",
        "converter.target_spec.supported_ops = [tf.lite.OpsSet.TFLITE_BUILTINS_INT8]\n",
        "converter.inference_input_type = tf.int8\n",
        "converter.inference_output_type = tf.int8\n",
        "\n",
        "tflite_model = converter.convert()\n",
        "\n",
        "tflite_path = os.environ.get(\"HAR_TFLITE_PATH\", os.path.join(os.getcwd(), \"wisdm_tinycnn_int8.tflite\"))"\n",
        "with open(tflite_path, \"wb\") as f:\n",
        "    f.write(tflite_model)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Saved:\", tflite_path, \"| size (KB):\", os.path.getsize(tflite_path)/1024)\n"
      ],
