        "\n",
        "A (Walking) has high precision (0.92) but very low recall (0.18) → the model rarely predicts “Walking”; it’s confusing walking with stairs or jogging or posture.\n",
        "\n",
        "That’s fixable. Here are the best next improvements (still power-friendly):"
