            "True: C | Pred: C | Conf: 0.496\n",
            "Explanation: Prediction: - Activity: C - Confidence: 0.50 Sensor statistics (from this window): - motion_mean: -0.154 - motion_std: 0.799 - jerk_mean: 0.828 - jerk_std: 1.209 - axis_std (x,y,z): 0.497, 0.433, 0.594\n",
            "\n",
            "===================================\n",
            "Sample idx 4922\n",
            "True: E | Pred: E | Conf: 0.836\n",
            "Explanation: Prediction: - Activity: E - Confidence: 0.84 Sensor statistics (from this window): - motion_mean: -0.308 - motion_std: 0.010 - jerk_mean: 0.007 - jerk_std: 0.009 - axis_std (x,y,z): 0.013, 0.009, 0.044\n"
